==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 1 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Lapras ex Drop Event]], which ran from November 5 to 18, 2024.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Reckless Charge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Movie VS Pack|Ash's Phanpy|4}} from the {{TCG|Movie Commemoration VS Pack: Aura's Lucario}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

